luaV_settable: after the primitive luaH_set, a readonly table raises luaG_runerror(L, "").

Justification (PLAYER bytes): luaV_settable 0x0098a3b0 tests byte [h+7] right after the luaH_set call
and calls luaG_runerror 0x008a8bb0 with 0x00bda1b8, which is the empty string "" (STUDIO 0x00a30140
does the same with its "" at 0x00c8f348). Not the 2016 message.

